OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine for
OL,6,Fmany this evening, although rather
OL,7,Fbreezy in places and feeling fairly
OL,8,Fhumid. Cloud and patchy rain will
OL,9,Fspread southeastwards overnight, but
OL,10,Fmany areas are likely to remain dry.
OL,11,FFresher conditions will gradually
OL,12,Fdevelop from the northwest by dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FRather cloudy at first but
OL,15,Fbrightening up, with some sunny spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping. However, winds will
OL,17,Fsteadily strengthen ahead of a band of
OL,18,Frain, occasionally heavy, pushing
OL,19,Feastwards during the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
