OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith blustery showers on Tuesday.
OL,7,FWinds and showers gradually easing
OL,8,FWednesday. Largely dry with light
OL,9,Fwinds Thursday, some showers in the
OL,10,Fwest. Temperatures around average for
OL,11,Fearly September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
